    "created_at": "2018-08-15T19:20:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-15T19:20:45Z",
    "body": "Specifying `text-align` on just the legend changes its position ([see demo](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/6102)), so I think they must be using the `text-align` on the legend.\r\n\r\ncc @eaenet",
